WEBVTT

01:30.600 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.350 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 23]

01:38.280 --> 01:40.539
Are we really going to stay here
at Li Ink?

01:41.070 --> 01:42.680
You need to understand one thing:

01:42.680 --> 01:44.080
when you are prosperous,

01:44.150 --> 01:46.200
there are always plenty of people

01:46.200 --> 01:47.680
eager to add flowers to your brocade;

01:47.680 --> 01:49.310
but when you fall into decline,

01:49.310 --> 01:51.280
those willing to offer help
in your darkest hour

01:51.280 --> 01:52.610
are few and far between.

01:53.280 --> 01:56.430
Since Miss Li Zhen is willing to
give me a hand at this moment,

01:56.430 --> 01:58.310
I'm willing to accept this kindness,

01:58.310 --> 01:59.780
and I'm willing to repay it.

01:59.780 --> 02:02.580
Then about your vendetta
against the Tian family…

02:03.480 --> 02:06.040
Of course I'll settle the score
with the Tian family.

02:06.040 --> 02:08.240
But now I've been stripped of my post

02:08.520 --> 02:10.560
and am completely penniless,

02:12.500 --> 02:14.350
the only thing we can do is

02:15.190 --> 02:17.560
devote ourselves fully to helping Li Ink.

02:18.150 --> 02:19.400
First, it's

02:19.680 --> 02:21.870
to repay Miss Li Zhen's kindness.

02:24.079 --> 02:24.800
And second,

02:25.680 --> 02:27.150
only if Li Ink turns a profit

02:27.150 --> 02:28.800
can we raise enough military funds

02:28.800 --> 02:30.120
to atone for our mistakes

02:30.120 --> 02:31.579
and return to Yihousheng.

02:31.800 --> 02:33.079
Understood, Master.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.430
Manager Zhen.

02:40.170 --> 02:41.430
What's wrong, Doggie?

02:41.680 --> 02:44.340
All the visiting cards sent to
the ink merchants

02:44.710 --> 02:46.150
have been returned.

02:51.750 --> 02:52.910
All of them?

02:53.310 --> 02:54.120
Zhen.

02:55.170 --> 02:57.410
Uncle Jingdong, good timing.

02:58.030 --> 03:00.430
I saw Doggie holding the cards here

03:00.430 --> 03:01.080
looking all flustered.

03:01.080 --> 03:01.940
What happened?

03:02.080 --> 03:03.280
Please sit down first.
Let's talk it through slowly.

03:03.280 --> 03:03.750
Okay.

03:03.800 --> 03:04.360
This way.

03:04.710 --> 03:05.520
Be careful.

03:09.190 --> 03:09.840
Doggie.

03:10.190 --> 03:10.870
Alright.

03:11.370 --> 03:13.090
Tell us everything in detail.

03:13.360 --> 03:15.840
Did you knock on their doors

03:15.870 --> 03:17.030
one by one to deliver these cards?

03:17.030 --> 03:17.800
Of course.

03:17.900 --> 03:19.240
Manager Zhen, I followed your orders

03:19.240 --> 03:21.240
and knocked on their doors one by one.

03:21.240 --> 03:22.870
But they were either not at home

03:22.870 --> 03:24.280
or sick.

03:24.550 --> 03:26.350
I did manage to meet a few of them,

03:26.590 --> 03:28.280
but as soon as they heard
I was from Li Ink,

03:28.280 --> 03:30.360
they wanted to drive me away immediately.

03:30.360 --> 03:31.890
That shouldn't be the case.

03:32.000 --> 03:33.910
I saw some of them a few days ago.

03:34.280 --> 03:37.240
Hearing that we sped up the repair work,

03:37.840 --> 03:39.190
they were quite happy

03:39.280 --> 03:41.340
and said they wanted to place orders.

03:42.520 --> 03:45.079
Doggie, did they say anything else

03:45.470 --> 03:47.120
when they drove you away?

03:47.310 --> 03:48.460
I refused to leave

03:48.490 --> 03:49.840
and asked a few servants.

03:49.840 --> 03:51.079
They just said

03:51.910 --> 03:53.750
that Li Ink had already
sold off its land and property

03:53.750 --> 03:55.560
and was hollowed out to this extent,

03:55.560 --> 03:57.190
yet we still wanted to trick people
into doing business with us.

03:57.190 --> 03:58.750
I told them it was not true

03:58.750 --> 04:00.710
and tried desperately to explain,
but they wouldn't listen,

04:00.710 --> 04:02.870
and then they drove me out.

04:03.240 --> 04:04.280
I see, Doggie.

04:04.560 --> 04:06.090
You may get back to work now.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.360
Doggie.

04:09.240 --> 04:11.240
Go check

04:11.840 --> 04:13.590
where this news started spreading from.

04:13.590 --> 04:14.280
Yes.

04:17.560 --> 04:18.600
No need to check.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.890
We're the only ones
who know the inside story.

04:23.750 --> 04:25.310
Tian Jiangyue... I'll go confront her.

04:25.310 --> 04:26.910
It's no use, Uncle Jingdong.

04:27.310 --> 04:29.570
Don't you know what kind of person she is?

04:29.660 --> 04:31.930
Even if you go to her, she won't admit it.

04:32.430 --> 04:35.030
Besides, we don't have any evidence
right now.

04:35.120 --> 04:37.510
Since this news
has already started spreading,

04:37.510 --> 04:39.240
the most urgent thing right now

04:39.360 --> 04:41.420
is to regain the ink merchants' trust

04:41.480 --> 04:42.600
in Li Ink.

04:45.310 --> 04:48.360
Did those ink merchants
really return all the visiting cards?

04:48.360 --> 04:49.600
Absolutely.

04:51.159 --> 04:52.720
If the ink merchants don't place orders,

04:52.720 --> 04:54.480
the deficit from Li Zhen
mortgaging the estate

04:54.480 --> 04:55.750
will never be covered.

04:55.950 --> 04:58.810
We'll see how she explains that
when the time comes.

05:05.000 --> 05:05.870
Master Jiang.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.830
Manager Zhen, you're here.

05:07.830 --> 05:09.920
You guys are eating, right?
Thanks for your hard work.

05:09.920 --> 05:10.510
It's okay. Don't mention it.

05:10.510 --> 05:11.370
Take your time.

05:12.160 --> 05:13.120
Miss Li Zhen, you're here.

05:13.120 --> 05:13.870
Xiao Qi.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.560
Where's your Master?

05:19.390 --> 05:20.390
These past few days,

05:20.390 --> 05:23.270
we've been busy helping the workers
renovate the ink workshop.

05:23.270 --> 05:26.000
Master was worried
rain would delay the project,

05:26.120 --> 05:29.630
so he stayed up all night working.

05:31.510 --> 05:33.310
I see. Thanks for your hard work.

06:07.630 --> 06:08.970
Can you stop bothering me?

06:08.970 --> 06:12.370
I was just dreaming about
eating something. What do you want?

06:16.800 --> 06:18.510
W-Why are you here?

06:20.750 --> 06:21.630
You must be tired.

06:21.630 --> 06:22.390
You worked all night.

06:22.390 --> 06:24.000
Why don't you go back and have a rest?

06:24.000 --> 06:25.240
I'm not tired.

06:25.600 --> 06:27.000
I was just slacking off.

06:27.270 --> 06:28.000
What's up?

06:29.070 --> 06:30.070
I'm actually here

06:30.310 --> 06:33.560
to ask you for a favor.

06:35.159 --> 06:35.800
Go ahead.

06:36.720 --> 06:37.990
Some time ago,

06:38.240 --> 06:39.950
in order to renovate the ink workshop,

06:39.950 --> 06:41.720
I mortgaged the estate.

06:42.120 --> 06:43.040
But now,

06:43.190 --> 06:45.680
word of the mortgage has gotten out,

06:46.560 --> 06:48.070
and all the major ink merchants

06:48.070 --> 06:49.730
don't trust the Li family anymore.

06:49.730 --> 06:50.610
-So...
-Wait.

06:51.680 --> 06:53.270
Word got out?

06:53.750 --> 06:55.080
Isn't that a huge tab...

06:55.510 --> 06:56.680
Taboo in doing business?

06:56.680 --> 06:59.920
Exactly. That's why I wanted to ask you
to step in

07:00.000 --> 07:01.750
and help me contact those ink merchants.

07:01.750 --> 07:03.750
We can put on a two-man act together.

07:07.240 --> 07:08.440
Let me think about it.

07:12.860 --> 07:13.990
Please come in, sir.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.000
Master.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.630
The Tian family obtained
the Tribute Ink monopoly,

07:17.630 --> 07:19.950
and with Lord Xu backing them
in the capital,

07:19.950 --> 07:22.920
they now have complete control
over the Huizhou ink industry.

07:22.920 --> 07:24.780
When will we ever get our revenge?

07:28.040 --> 07:30.720
Revenge is a dish best served cold.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.800
I underestimated them before.

07:34.270 --> 07:35.670
I thought the Tian family

07:35.830 --> 07:39.120
were nothing more than a bunch of rats
that thrived in the shadows.

07:39.120 --> 07:42.580
I never expected them to be snakes
emerging from hibernation.

07:44.920 --> 07:46.120
But do you know

07:46.720 --> 07:49.040
when the best time to catch a snake is?

07:50.159 --> 07:52.220
It's right after it's eaten its fill.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.310
Eaten its fill?

07:56.870 --> 07:57.600
Master.

07:58.560 --> 08:01.040
But we've got nothing now.

08:01.240 --> 08:03.720
Those ink merchants used to
suck up to you all day,

08:03.720 --> 08:05.480
and you couldn't even
be bothered with them.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.800
But now,

08:07.000 --> 08:07.920
for Li Ink,

08:07.950 --> 08:09.800
you have to swallow your pride
and beg them?

08:09.800 --> 08:11.310
What kind of situation is this?

08:11.310 --> 08:13.040
Who said I was going to beg them?

08:14.480 --> 08:16.310
Miss Li Zhen has a point.

08:16.870 --> 08:18.270
The name Qi Jiu

08:18.600 --> 08:21.270
is still more than enough to deal with
those ink merchants.

08:21.270 --> 08:22.160
Master.

08:22.600 --> 08:24.070
But once they see Miss Li Zhen,

08:24.070 --> 08:25.670
won't they just leave again?

08:26.040 --> 08:27.440
They'll be there anyway.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.680
Once they arrive,

08:28.930 --> 08:31.010
Zhen will have a way to make them stay.

08:31.040 --> 08:32.360
After all, she's so smart,

08:32.360 --> 08:33.030
right?

08:41.030 --> 08:43.030
Go to Cuiqiao's place later

08:43.440 --> 08:44.480
and borrow

08:45.390 --> 08:47.510
that overcoat of mine trimmed with
silver fox fur

08:47.510 --> 08:48.240
for me.

08:49.840 --> 08:50.600
Master.

08:51.200 --> 08:52.480
It's just the beginning of autumn.

08:52.480 --> 08:54.610
Why would you wear a fur-trimmed coat?

08:55.000 --> 08:57.270
Fine feathers make fine birds, you know?

08:58.360 --> 08:59.790
But that coat is so expensive.

08:59.790 --> 09:02.050
How could Cuiqiao possibly lend it to me?

09:04.630 --> 09:05.270
Look,

09:05.910 --> 09:07.150
this is where

09:07.150 --> 09:08.950
I know you better than yourself.

09:09.550 --> 09:10.600
What do you mean?

09:13.750 --> 09:15.600
Playing cute and throwing tantrums—

09:15.600 --> 09:17.200
you are better at it than I am.

09:17.670 --> 09:19.840
Just sweet-talk Cuiqiao a bit,
and she'll definitely lend it to you.

09:19.840 --> 09:22.550
Anyway, you going is better than
me going, right?

09:22.550 --> 09:24.440
I've got that kind of ability?

09:24.440 --> 09:25.720
Sure you do.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.670
Tell Cuiqiao

09:28.870 --> 09:32.130
that I'll definitely return it
in its original condition.

09:34.270 --> 09:35.330
I'll go right away.

09:35.510 --> 09:36.910
Be quick. I'll wait for you here.

09:36.910 --> 09:37.600
Hurry up.

09:39.540 --> 09:40.540
Alright. Please.

09:42.870 --> 09:43.910
Master Qi,

09:44.490 --> 09:47.900
what brings you to suddenly invite us here

09:48.550 --> 09:50.030
for drinks today?

09:50.840 --> 09:53.960
I'd heard that this garden is tranquil and
elegantly refined, a hidden paradise of its own.

09:53.960 --> 09:56.960
There's nothing more pleasant
than gathering here for a nice chat.

09:56.960 --> 09:59.080
It's just that I, Qi Jiu,

09:59.320 --> 10:00.480
was ignorant and poorly informed.

10:00.480 --> 10:02.600
It's truly a pity that

10:02.670 --> 10:04.670
I only learned about this place today.

10:04.670 --> 10:06.960
However, all of you seniors

10:07.120 --> 10:09.600
are natives of Huizhou,

10:09.670 --> 10:12.480
so I'm sure the scenic and
culturally rich places of Huizhou

10:12.480 --> 10:14.390
are familiar to you
like the back of your hand.

10:14.390 --> 10:17.510
So today's invitation to stroll the garden
and enjoy some wine is really

10:17.510 --> 10:19.910
just my way of offering
a modest beginning.

10:20.240 --> 10:23.270
I hope you seniors can show me

10:23.360 --> 10:26.440
more of the world within Huizhou City
in the future.

10:26.910 --> 10:27.840
Sure, sure.

10:28.750 --> 10:29.390
Here.

10:30.270 --> 10:31.630
Another toast to you seniors.

10:31.630 --> 10:32.430
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

10:32.430 --> 10:33.030
Please.

10:38.600 --> 10:39.330
Please, sit.

10:39.870 --> 10:40.510
Please.

10:40.960 --> 10:41.510
Please.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.490
You are too kind, Master Qi.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.150
We've long heard

10:49.240 --> 10:52.270
that you followed Marshal Qi
in battles across the country.

10:52.270 --> 10:54.910
You've seen much more of the world
than we have.

10:54.910 --> 10:55.270
Exactly.

10:55.270 --> 10:56.000
You flatter me.

10:56.000 --> 10:59.510
We've been ink merchants in Huizhou
for generations.

11:00.120 --> 11:01.840
Outside of this small place,

11:02.240 --> 11:03.720
we know nowhere.

11:03.790 --> 11:05.000
That's right.

11:05.680 --> 11:09.080
Now, since a pine wilt epidemic
has broken out across Huizhou

11:09.240 --> 11:12.440
and pine soot ink has become
scarce and expensive,

11:12.750 --> 11:15.750
we've been thinking of looking elsewhere

11:15.750 --> 11:19.600
to see whether there are any ink workshops
capable of producing pine soot ink.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.550
Unfortunately,

11:21.120 --> 11:23.030
once we leave Huizhou,

11:23.360 --> 11:26.480
nobody recognizes us
or gives weight to our names.

11:26.960 --> 11:27.670
Indeed.

11:27.750 --> 11:29.150
This pine wilt epidemic has affected

11:29.150 --> 11:31.600
the overall landscape
of the Huizhou ink industry.

11:31.600 --> 11:33.360
I, Qi Jiu,
truly am also in a difficult position.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.240
But today,

11:35.390 --> 11:38.750
since I'm here drinking
and enjoying myself with you seniors,

11:38.750 --> 11:41.480
let's not bring up
such mood-killing matters.

11:41.550 --> 11:42.030
Please.

11:42.310 --> 11:43.370
Alright, alright.

11:50.200 --> 11:51.120
Master Qi.

11:51.200 --> 11:53.360
You're on good terms with Official Fan,

11:53.360 --> 11:56.290
and you handle the military supplies
for Marshal Qi.

11:56.790 --> 11:59.030
Judging by your spirit and style,

11:59.650 --> 12:01.250
you must be doing quite well.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.770
Could you please

12:03.200 --> 12:05.200
give us a clear direction to follow?

12:05.270 --> 12:06.600
In the current situation,

12:06.600 --> 12:09.270
whose ink and what kind of ink

12:09.720 --> 12:11.580
would bring the greatest profit?

12:12.750 --> 12:14.840
Mr. Zhou, business secrets...

12:14.840 --> 12:16.200
Master! Master!

12:16.230 --> 12:16.870
The ink...

12:24.440 --> 12:25.600
May I have a word?

12:27.600 --> 12:28.480
Managers.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.960
He's got the ink orders.

12:37.750 --> 12:38.910
The ink orders.

12:39.510 --> 12:40.510
The ink orders.

12:41.240 --> 12:42.480
Good, good.

12:48.120 --> 12:48.750
Please.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.390
Please, please.

12:53.750 --> 12:57.150
Now that the Tribute Ink
has chosen the Tian family's ink,

12:57.200 --> 12:58.670
it's both expensive
and hard to secure orders for.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.550
That's right.

12:59.790 --> 13:01.840
We're truly at a loss.

13:02.390 --> 13:03.390
Master Qi,

13:03.630 --> 13:06.360
please enlighten us.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.150
Yes, Master Qi.

13:09.600 --> 13:12.320
Please give us some guidance.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.200
Alright, thanks.

13:16.840 --> 13:18.500
To be honest with you seniors,

13:18.510 --> 13:20.510
I did find some

13:20.550 --> 13:22.440
more reasonably priced orders,

13:22.550 --> 13:25.350
and the quality is no worse than
the Tian family's.

13:27.000 --> 13:29.120
I've already secured
sales channels myself,

13:29.120 --> 13:30.360
so I'm not worried at all

13:30.360 --> 13:31.750
about the profits from these orders.

13:31.750 --> 13:35.120
But if I divide these orders
among you seniors,

13:36.000 --> 13:38.390
there's no guarantee you'd be able to

13:38.440 --> 13:40.270
sell everything through your own channels.

13:40.270 --> 13:43.070
In that case, the profits
couldn't be guaranteed.

13:43.440 --> 13:44.200
Secondly,

13:44.790 --> 13:47.270
the size of these ink orders

13:47.650 --> 13:50.290
truly isn't enough
to even support me alone.

13:50.320 --> 13:53.240
So please understand, seniors.

13:53.870 --> 13:55.670
It's okay. No worries.

13:56.630 --> 13:58.910
May I just ask you, Master Qi,

13:59.320 --> 14:00.840
which ink workshop is it?

14:01.240 --> 14:02.120
Could you

14:02.630 --> 14:04.550
please tell us clearly?

14:04.670 --> 14:05.550
Master Qi,

14:05.790 --> 14:07.550
we can also cooperate with them

14:07.630 --> 14:08.830
and profit together.

14:09.240 --> 14:10.150
Seniors.

14:10.390 --> 14:12.150
Let's focus on eating. Please.

14:12.390 --> 14:13.320
Please. Please.

14:13.360 --> 14:16.000
Master Qi, we'd like to
propose a toast to you together.

14:16.000 --> 14:16.870
To Master Qi.

14:16.870 --> 14:17.670
To Master Qi.

14:17.670 --> 14:18.320
Well...

14:22.510 --> 14:24.720
Thank you for your favor

14:24.790 --> 14:26.480
and trust in me, seniors.

14:27.030 --> 14:28.150
Then I'll

14:28.750 --> 14:29.880
reluctantly agree.

14:30.310 --> 14:32.370
After we finish eating and drinking,

14:32.670 --> 14:35.270
how about you seniors come with me
to take a look

14:35.270 --> 14:35.840
around the ink workshop?

14:35.840 --> 14:36.960
-Sure.
-Sure.

14:36.980 --> 14:37.460
Please.

14:43.270 --> 14:45.030
I've never heard of any ink workshop here.

14:45.030 --> 14:45.870
Exactly.

14:46.600 --> 14:47.730
Where is this place?

14:50.670 --> 14:52.360
Hello, elders.

14:54.440 --> 14:56.360
Isn't this Manager Zhen?

14:57.670 --> 15:00.150
So this is Li Ink Workshop?

15:01.480 --> 15:02.630
That's not right.

15:03.160 --> 15:05.090
Li Ink Workshop is on Sibao Street.

15:05.100 --> 15:05.630
So this is...

15:05.630 --> 15:06.360
Elders,

15:06.360 --> 15:08.440
this is our Li family's old ink workshop,

15:08.440 --> 15:10.720
but now it's also our new ink workshop.

15:10.820 --> 15:12.510
Since you're already here, elders,

15:12.510 --> 15:14.240
why not go in and take a look?

15:15.550 --> 15:16.550
Manager Zhen.

15:17.750 --> 15:18.320
This...

15:18.630 --> 15:22.080
Master Qi, this is rather underhanded.

15:22.890 --> 15:24.820
I've still got things to do at home.

15:25.630 --> 15:26.510
I'll take my leave.

15:26.510 --> 15:27.200
Me too.

15:27.690 --> 15:29.450
Elders. Dear elders.

15:29.480 --> 15:31.910
I know you are all busy,

15:32.150 --> 15:33.750
but in this old ink workshop now,

15:33.750 --> 15:35.670
there really are things worth seeing.

15:35.670 --> 15:36.670
Since you're already here,

15:36.670 --> 15:38.080
elders, please do me a favor

15:38.080 --> 15:39.610
and go inside to take a look.

15:41.000 --> 15:41.910
Manager Zhen.

15:43.960 --> 15:45.320
We just want to ask you:

15:45.870 --> 15:47.790
is it true that your Li family

15:47.790 --> 15:49.450
sold off your houses and land?

15:50.550 --> 15:52.670
It's a misunderstanding,
truly a misunderstanding.

15:52.670 --> 15:53.630
We mortgaged it.

15:54.030 --> 15:55.430
We mortgaged the estate.

15:55.840 --> 15:58.440
And in fact, this is precisely
the Li family's determination

15:58.440 --> 16:01.320
to devote everything we have to ensuring
Li Ink continues operating normally.

16:01.320 --> 16:04.200
Every bit of that money has been spent
on maintaining production.

16:04.200 --> 16:07.240
Once you go inside and take a look,
you'll understand.

16:07.630 --> 16:08.600
Manager Zhen.

16:09.030 --> 16:10.440
Doing business

16:10.670 --> 16:12.390
requires mutual consent.

16:13.240 --> 16:16.270
No matter what, there is no reason
for forced buying and selling.

16:16.270 --> 16:17.120
Right.

16:18.750 --> 16:20.080
Please just step aside,

16:20.240 --> 16:22.480
so we can save face.

16:23.080 --> 16:23.840
Mr. Zhou.

16:24.910 --> 16:26.640
Even if you don't want to see me,

16:26.750 --> 16:29.080
you should at least see my grandfather.

16:30.270 --> 16:31.130
Grandpa!

16:32.240 --> 16:33.240
Grandpa!

16:33.980 --> 16:35.310
Grandpa, come quickly.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.160
Come here, Grandpa.

16:38.390 --> 16:39.550
Look who's here.

16:42.070 --> 16:42.810
Zhou Ren?

16:43.550 --> 16:44.360
Zhou Ren.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.200
Eighth Master Li.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.270
Long time no see.

16:46.270 --> 16:46.790
Long time no see.

16:46.790 --> 16:48.200
How many years has it been?

16:48.200 --> 16:49.240
Exactly.

16:49.300 --> 16:50.760
What brings you guys here?

16:50.790 --> 16:52.120
Mr. Zhou came to see

16:52.120 --> 16:54.080
the new look of our old smoke shed.

16:55.030 --> 16:56.000
Uncles,

16:56.200 --> 16:58.510
although the Li family's smoke shed

16:58.510 --> 16:59.840
cannot be used temporarily,

16:59.840 --> 17:01.440
the smoke shed of our old ink workshop

17:01.440 --> 17:03.750
is now burning hot.

17:03.840 --> 17:04.740
These past few days,

17:04.740 --> 17:06.599
Grandpa has been helping to direct inside.

17:06.599 --> 17:08.130
Isn't that right, Grandpa?

17:09.680 --> 17:12.880
Since you're already here,
you should take a look around.

17:13.960 --> 17:14.720
Please come in.

17:14.720 --> 17:15.790
Now that Grandpa has said that,

17:15.790 --> 17:17.319
please go in and take a look.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.880
It won't take long.

17:18.880 --> 17:20.270
Yes, take a look around.

17:20.800 --> 17:21.400
Please.

17:21.480 --> 17:22.680
Okay, Eighth Master Li.

17:22.680 --> 17:23.440
Come on.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.680
Eighth Master Li, you might not know.

17:30.680 --> 17:32.080
You pushed a bit too hard.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.420
Elders, please take a look.

17:37.420 --> 17:39.950
This is our dragon kiln
for burning pine soot.

17:41.070 --> 17:43.440
I'm sure you've all

17:43.590 --> 17:44.680
seen our Li family's Origin Ink

17:44.680 --> 17:46.030
during the Tribute Ink selection earlier.

17:46.030 --> 17:46.960
The soot used for the Origin Ink

17:46.960 --> 17:48.480
is burned a bit longer,

17:48.480 --> 17:50.030
so it actually requires less pine timber

17:50.030 --> 17:52.720
than ordinary pine soot ink.

17:54.030 --> 17:56.270
These piles of pine timber were specially

17:56.270 --> 17:58.240
brought back from Mount Huangshan
by Sixth Grandfather,

17:58.240 --> 17:59.680
and they are of excellent quality.

17:59.680 --> 18:02.160
These piles of pine timber
are enough to support Li Ink's

18:02.160 --> 18:04.420
production of Origin Ink for half a year.

18:05.030 --> 18:07.550
And I assure you

18:07.680 --> 18:08.750
that our pricing

18:08.770 --> 18:10.700
will absolutely not be affected

18:10.790 --> 18:12.850
or driven up by the pine wilt disease.

18:12.960 --> 18:14.090
Please come inside.

18:17.750 --> 18:19.790
Here is our oil soot shed.

18:22.450 --> 18:23.680
This is the lacquer-soot ink shed.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.940
Elders, please feel free to look around.

18:27.160 --> 18:27.960
Manager Zhen.

18:27.960 --> 18:28.790
Mr. Zhou.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.440
These masters are all the most

18:30.440 --> 18:32.900
experienced craftsmen in the ink workshop.

18:33.790 --> 18:35.920
Elders, as you all know,

18:36.350 --> 18:38.590
only good soot can produce good ink.

18:38.590 --> 18:39.940
According to our Li Ink's rules,

18:39.940 --> 18:41.480
normally, we do not accept any lampblack

18:41.480 --> 18:43.750
below medium-grade.

18:43.750 --> 18:46.750
We only accept fine-grade
and supreme-grade lampblack.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.550
After these lampblack batches
are individually inspected

18:48.550 --> 18:49.680
by the master craftsmen,

18:49.680 --> 18:51.070
they're sent straight to Li Ink Workshop.

18:51.070 --> 18:52.920
Over there, the glue mixing
and ink-making process

18:52.920 --> 18:54.590
begins immediately
without a moment's delay.

18:54.590 --> 18:55.550
Elders,

18:55.880 --> 18:57.960
this is our supreme-grade lampblack.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.620
Please feel free to appraise.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.560
Mr. Zhou, please take a look.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.400
Here.

19:30.830 --> 19:34.030
Elders, you all truly care about Li Ink.

19:34.240 --> 19:36.160
This year, Li Ink has suffered from
both internal and external troubles,

19:36.160 --> 19:37.720
making you all worry.

19:37.880 --> 19:40.940
It's only right that I punish myself
with 3 cups of wine.

19:43.890 --> 19:46.040
This first cup is to all of you elders.

19:52.550 --> 19:53.410
The second cup.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.130
The third cup...

20:00.200 --> 20:02.440
There's no need for a young lady
like you to do that.

20:02.440 --> 20:04.640
We already understand your sincerity.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.400
Yes.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.400
Mr. Ji.

20:06.550 --> 20:08.720
Please don't treat me
as just a young lady.

20:08.720 --> 20:11.160
Back then, however you used to
slam the dinner table

20:11.160 --> 20:12.480
and negotiate profit shares
with my Sixth

20:12.480 --> 20:13.920
and Seventh Grandfathers—

20:13.920 --> 20:16.550
please negotiate with me
the very same way today.

20:16.550 --> 20:17.350
The third cup.

20:18.160 --> 20:18.960
I'll drink it.

20:20.070 --> 20:20.750
Excellent.

20:21.110 --> 20:22.440
Manager Zhen, that's impressive.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.400
Mr. Jiang.

20:23.550 --> 20:25.400
My grandfather mentioned you many times.

20:25.400 --> 20:27.400
He said that
through your own efforts alone,

20:27.400 --> 20:29.270
you managed to sell our Li Ink
all the way to Ganzhou.

20:29.270 --> 20:31.640
That's what's truly impressive.

20:33.790 --> 20:34.830
And Mr. Ji,

20:34.830 --> 20:36.200
I forgot to mention just now.

20:36.200 --> 20:38.830
I heard your son is very knowledgeable.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.800
He'll surely pass the autumn imperial exam
next year.

20:40.800 --> 20:43.060
When the time comes,
our Li Ink will definitely invite your son

20:43.060 --> 20:45.140
to write a new plaque for us.

20:45.720 --> 20:48.720
How come you even know
these things, Manager Zhen?

20:48.720 --> 20:50.030
Of course I know.

20:50.030 --> 20:52.160
Here, thanks for your kind words.
Let's drink.

20:52.160 --> 20:52.590
Here.

20:52.640 --> 20:53.200
Alright.

20:58.110 --> 20:59.160
And Mr. Zhou.

20:59.270 --> 21:01.830
You're the greatest contributor to Li Ink.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.030
Over the years, Li Ink

21:04.030 --> 21:05.960
couldn't have survived
without your support and help.

21:05.960 --> 21:07.350
I, Zhen, would like to toast to you.

21:07.350 --> 21:07.830
Here.

21:09.880 --> 21:10.750
Managers.

21:11.070 --> 21:13.800
We've prepared nice food
to go with the fine wine.

21:14.000 --> 21:15.440
Let's eat and talk.

21:18.270 --> 21:19.640
We've had the wine,

21:19.640 --> 21:22.030
and we appreciate
your generous hospitality.

21:22.030 --> 21:24.590
We've also seen your capability firsthand.

21:24.680 --> 21:26.270
The fact that you managed to restore

21:26.270 --> 21:28.110
Li Ink's production so quickly—

21:28.720 --> 21:29.850
I truly admire that.

21:30.480 --> 21:32.110
But business is business.

21:32.200 --> 21:34.880
Li Ink today is no longer
what it used to be.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.310
First, it suffered from
the pine wilt disease,

21:37.310 --> 21:40.590
then the fire that damaged the workshop.

21:40.720 --> 21:41.680
And now

21:42.030 --> 21:43.830
you've even mortgaged your property.

21:43.830 --> 21:46.440
It's obvious that you're desperate

21:46.440 --> 21:48.310
to get money and orders from us

21:48.350 --> 21:51.300
in order to cover the losses
and keep operations running.

21:51.300 --> 21:52.610
That's a risk

21:53.240 --> 21:55.200
we simply can't afford to take.

21:56.880 --> 21:59.550
Mr. Zhou, I understand your concerns.

22:00.000 --> 22:02.590
But elders, as you all have seen today,

22:02.750 --> 22:04.070
the lampblack-making process

22:04.070 --> 22:06.200
has already started running
in the old ink workshop.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.880
As for the other damages to Li Ink,

22:08.960 --> 22:11.160
they'll definitely be repaired
within a month and a half.

22:11.160 --> 22:13.350
It absolutely won't affect
Li Ink's delivery.

22:13.350 --> 22:15.640
Please rest assured, elders.

22:16.480 --> 22:17.510
Manager Zhen,

22:17.960 --> 22:20.220
what you said is the best-case scenario.

22:20.350 --> 22:21.750
But since your foundation has weakened,

22:21.750 --> 22:24.310
the slightest setback
could make it collapse.

22:24.310 --> 22:26.070
And if production gets interrupted,

22:26.070 --> 22:28.110
what do you plan to use to compensate us?

22:28.110 --> 22:29.030
Exactly.

22:31.070 --> 22:32.640
Elders, please be patient.

22:32.640 --> 22:34.900
I've made thorough preparations today.

22:35.680 --> 22:36.550
Master Qi.

22:38.000 --> 22:39.930
Everything's long been prepared.

22:40.200 --> 22:41.070
Managers,

22:41.880 --> 22:43.280
please take a look first.

22:43.680 --> 22:44.350
Here.

22:52.110 --> 22:53.830
What you elders are looking at

22:54.160 --> 22:56.790
is the shareholding contract
for our New Li Ink Workshop.

22:56.790 --> 22:59.160
It's clearly written in black and white

22:59.200 --> 23:02.030
that if you elders
place an order for our Li Ink

23:02.070 --> 23:04.480
and don't receive the goods
by the agreed date,

23:04.480 --> 23:05.750
you'll automatically become

23:05.750 --> 23:08.010
shareholders of our New Li Ink Workshop.

23:09.640 --> 23:10.720
Last year, our New Li Ink Workshop

23:10.720 --> 23:12.720
made an annual profit of 500 taels.

23:13.310 --> 23:15.240
This year, it will only increase.

23:15.640 --> 23:17.640
Calculated at 10 shares per person,

23:17.750 --> 23:21.080
each of you would receive
50 taels of silver this year alone.

23:25.590 --> 23:26.550
Managers,

23:26.920 --> 23:30.270
I'm sure you've all heard about

23:30.480 --> 23:32.480
how well Fu Jin Ink has been selling.

23:33.160 --> 23:34.240
And I

23:34.750 --> 23:37.210
am also one of the shareholders
of New Li Ink.

23:37.240 --> 23:40.510
So the dividends have always been
generous and never lacking.

23:40.510 --> 23:43.370
I believe that, especially in these
unusual times,

23:43.750 --> 23:47.830
this is the greatest assurance
that Manager Zhen can offer you.

23:49.880 --> 23:51.400
This is like using your own lifeblood

23:51.400 --> 23:53.460
to fill the hole in Li Ink's finances.

23:53.790 --> 23:55.750
The Eighth Branch hasn't even returned
to the clan yet.

23:55.750 --> 23:56.960
Manager Zhen, are you really willing to

23:56.960 --> 23:58.920
make such a huge sacrifice?

23:59.530 --> 24:01.730
Mr. Zhou, you're mistaken.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.330
This isn't a sacrifice.

24:03.400 --> 24:06.310
It's my confidence in Li Ink.

24:11.920 --> 24:12.720
Alright.

24:13.310 --> 24:14.720
I'll sign this contract.

24:15.960 --> 24:17.680
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.510
I'll sign it too.

24:18.510 --> 24:19.680
Thanks a lot, Mr. Ji.

24:19.680 --> 24:20.510
And me.

24:20.510 --> 24:21.790
Thanks a lot, Mr. Jiang.

24:21.790 --> 24:23.070
I won't say anything more.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.750
Here's a toast to all you elders.

24:24.750 --> 24:26.920
We agreed we were going to
have another round of drinks.

24:26.920 --> 24:27.830
See you, Manager Zhen.

24:27.830 --> 24:29.070
No need to see us out.

24:29.440 --> 24:30.550
We insist.

24:30.550 --> 24:31.680
When new ink comes out later,

24:31.680 --> 24:32.880
make sure to let us know first.

24:32.880 --> 24:34.240
I definitely will.

24:34.310 --> 24:35.000
See you.

24:35.000 --> 24:35.750
Take care, elders.

24:35.750 --> 24:38.350
Next time. Let's continue drinking
next time.

24:38.720 --> 24:39.350
Alright.

24:39.640 --> 24:41.030
Take care, elders.

24:41.030 --> 24:42.750
See them out properly, Xiao Qi.

24:42.750 --> 24:43.480
No problem.

24:49.830 --> 24:50.760
Watch your step.

24:50.880 --> 24:53.480
There's still half a pot left.
Let's finish it.

24:53.550 --> 24:55.880
Half a pot. T-There's still a little left.

24:56.030 --> 24:57.030
Can you handle it?

24:57.510 --> 24:58.350
I'm fine.

24:58.680 --> 24:59.240
Let's go.

24:59.240 --> 25:00.640
That's exactly what I intended.

25:00.640 --> 25:00.920
Let's go. Let's go.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.680
Haven't had enough. Let's go.

25:06.170 --> 25:08.370
Thank you, Master Qi.

25:10.680 --> 25:12.220
Congratulations, Manager Zhen.

25:12.220 --> 25:13.670
Thank you, Master Qi.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.920
Congratulations, Manager Zhen.

25:14.920 --> 25:16.640
-Thank you, Master Qi!
-Congratulations.

25:16.640 --> 25:17.830
I said thank you!

25:17.830 --> 25:18.960
Congratulations to you.

25:18.960 --> 25:20.720
Congratulations to you.
Congratulations. Congratulations.

25:20.720 --> 25:22.180
You don't have to thank me.

25:23.750 --> 25:24.350
If you're throwing up,

25:24.350 --> 25:25.110
don't throw up on yourself.

25:25.110 --> 25:27.570
It'll be hard to wash.
Throw up on me instead.

25:29.080 --> 25:29.840
Master!

25:29.860 --> 25:30.990
Back away!

25:32.790 --> 25:33.850
Back away for what?

25:38.960 --> 25:40.090
Quick, take it away.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.350
Are you okay?

25:45.110 --> 25:46.590
Take it a bit further away.

26:03.240 --> 26:04.770
It's new. It doesn't smell.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.830
The smell of rouge ink.

26:11.440 --> 26:12.480
Rouge...

26:13.250 --> 26:13.830
Ink?

26:16.440 --> 26:17.400
No. No.

26:19.160 --> 26:19.830
No.

26:20.440 --> 26:22.440
No such smell. You smelled it wrong.

26:25.110 --> 26:25.790
What...

26:36.110 --> 26:36.720
Zhen.

26:37.160 --> 26:39.160
Come on, get up.

26:39.310 --> 26:40.770
Drink this hangover soup.

26:41.680 --> 26:44.000
Mother, my head hurts so much.

26:44.000 --> 26:45.240
Now you know it hurts.

26:45.270 --> 26:46.240
Why didn't you know

26:46.240 --> 26:47.790
to drink less yesterday?

26:47.960 --> 26:49.890
Come on, drink this hangover soup.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.640
You really are...

26:52.640 --> 26:54.270
Why did you drink so much?

26:54.270 --> 26:54.750
Here,

27:00.440 --> 27:01.370
drink some more.

27:01.960 --> 27:05.200
Mother, I didn't drink
for nothing yesterday.

27:05.810 --> 27:08.010
I secured an order for 100 sticks of ink.

27:08.750 --> 27:10.640
You really risked your life for it,

27:10.640 --> 27:11.680
but that credit

27:11.750 --> 27:13.550
might not necessarily go to you.

27:14.030 --> 27:17.030
Always doing thankless tasks
that take a ton of effort.

27:17.030 --> 27:18.310
Drink it all. Be good.

27:19.070 --> 27:20.240
Bitter.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.640
Now you know it's bitter.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.270
Why didn't you know

27:22.270 --> 27:23.790
to drink less when you were drinking?

27:23.790 --> 27:25.030
Come on.

27:28.920 --> 27:30.350
Drink it all.

27:31.110 --> 27:32.000
It's too bitter.

27:32.000 --> 27:33.730
I want to sleep a little longer.

27:41.550 --> 27:42.310
There's no rush, Granny.

27:42.310 --> 27:44.040
We're almost there. It's okay.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.590
I don't go out much,

27:55.480 --> 27:58.160
and I don't know much about
what's going on out there.

27:58.160 --> 28:00.030
If Wanyi hadn't sent someone,

28:01.160 --> 28:03.160
I wouldn't have known you were sick.

28:05.480 --> 28:06.790
Forgive me, Granny.

28:07.120 --> 28:11.220
[Ugly Granny Li]

28:07.400 --> 28:09.400
Mother repeatedly told me before

28:09.590 --> 28:11.300
not to let anyone see you.

28:11.920 --> 28:14.400
But Mother has been taking medicine
for days,

28:14.400 --> 28:16.260
and she hasn't gotten any better.

28:16.510 --> 28:18.070
I'm really worried.

28:19.240 --> 28:20.640
I'll look after her.

28:22.960 --> 28:24.510
I know

28:25.240 --> 28:26.500
Rujun's temperament.

28:28.160 --> 28:30.360
She still has things she can't let go of.

28:31.510 --> 28:33.370
She'll definitely pull through.

28:34.480 --> 28:36.030
This is 6 buckets of glue,

28:36.030 --> 28:36.720
right? In total.

28:36.720 --> 28:37.200
Yes, 6 buckets.

28:37.200 --> 28:37.790
Okay.

28:40.400 --> 28:41.880
One, two, three.

28:42.000 --> 28:42.790
Five.

28:43.350 --> 28:44.590
You've moved over that box, right?

28:44.590 --> 28:44.920
Yes.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.480
It's 5 portions.

28:45.480 --> 28:46.030
Yes, exactly 5 portions.

28:46.030 --> 28:46.550
Okay.

29:09.110 --> 29:10.160
Don't worry.

29:10.480 --> 29:13.280
I'll safely escort the Tribute Ink
to His Majesty.

29:14.200 --> 29:14.830
Ronghua.

29:14.930 --> 29:15.830
When you reach the post station,

29:15.830 --> 29:17.430
remember to send me a letter.

29:17.640 --> 29:21.110
Make sure to send word of your safety
after entering the Capital.

29:21.110 --> 29:22.880
Give Aunt Wan my regards.

29:23.350 --> 29:25.950
Mention your two brothers more
in front of her.

29:26.000 --> 29:28.830
Tell her we'll go visit her
when spring comes.

29:29.510 --> 29:30.270
Dear sister,

29:30.740 --> 29:32.140
help me keep an eye out for

29:32.160 --> 29:34.350
unmarried young ladies in the Capital.

29:34.350 --> 29:35.720
Take care, Mother.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.880
Our family is now a Tribute Ink supplier.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.480
Our status is much higher now.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.790
Make sure to find beautiful wives
for us...

29:40.790 --> 29:41.850
It's getting late.

29:42.200 --> 29:44.960
Sage Qing He is still waiting for me
at the city gate.

29:44.960 --> 29:46.760
I'd better not delay any longer.

29:47.400 --> 29:48.640
Take care, everyone.

29:49.790 --> 29:50.650
Lift the sedan.

29:52.790 --> 29:54.110
Our girl managed to

29:54.550 --> 29:56.200
latch onto Qing He,

29:56.510 --> 29:57.640
and now she's gotten

29:58.070 --> 29:59.560
so full of herself.

30:03.750 --> 30:05.550
Sheng, come pack things with me.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.160
It's not just her

30:10.200 --> 30:11.840
who can win Qing He over.

30:14.510 --> 30:15.480
You have a way?

30:16.440 --> 30:18.350
That guy doesn't even want money.

30:18.790 --> 30:20.720
I can't figure out what his game is.

30:22.350 --> 30:24.750
That's because we didn't think it through.

30:25.550 --> 30:28.480
With Sage Qing He's current prestige
in the Capital,

30:28.480 --> 30:30.010
he has no shortage of money.

30:31.000 --> 30:32.110
I looked into it.

30:32.720 --> 30:35.070
These days, century-old pine soot ink

30:35.090 --> 30:37.020
is indeed very rare in the capital.

30:37.440 --> 30:39.440
Since he specifically asked for it,

30:39.550 --> 30:42.400
whether he's offering it to immortals
or living people,

30:42.400 --> 30:43.880
he must have his own purpose for it.

30:43.880 --> 30:46.440
The problem is, right now
in all of Huizhou,

30:46.680 --> 30:48.880
where can we find such fine pine timber?

30:50.070 --> 30:51.000
Sure we can.

30:52.440 --> 30:55.160
The batch the Li family's Sixth Master
brought down from Mount Huang

30:55.160 --> 30:57.290
is top-quality pine timber, isn't it?

30:57.830 --> 31:00.200
How could the Li family possibly
let you use their pine timber?

31:00.200 --> 31:00.880
Father.

31:02.310 --> 31:04.750
I went to see the Sage
in private yesterday

31:05.110 --> 31:07.110
and agreed to the pine soot ink deal.

31:07.110 --> 31:08.370
The Sage was overjoyed

31:08.680 --> 31:10.510
and gave Lord Yan a heads-up,

31:11.270 --> 31:13.670
forcing him to write an official document.

31:14.000 --> 31:15.550
Can this really be pulled off?

31:15.550 --> 31:17.550
Nothing's going to go wrong, right?

31:17.830 --> 31:20.630
Then why didn't your sister
mention this just now?

31:22.400 --> 31:23.860
She doesn't know about it.

31:25.590 --> 31:26.720
I promise you,

31:27.440 --> 31:29.570
the wealth and glory of our Tian family

31:30.070 --> 31:31.590
are only just beginning.

31:38.070 --> 31:38.960
Steward Shao.

31:39.510 --> 31:41.640
The Tian family's Second Young Master
has arrived with a whole group of people.

31:41.640 --> 31:44.770
He's been making a scene,
demanding to see Manager Zhen.

31:45.000 --> 31:47.400
Is the Head of Li Ink here or not?

31:47.590 --> 31:48.440
Shout.

31:48.480 --> 31:50.270
Come out! Come out!

31:49.800 --> 31:53.370
[Li Ink]

31:50.290 --> 31:51.750
Second Young Master Tian.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.440
What are you doing here?

31:53.440 --> 31:55.770
Isn't Li Zhen the manager
of the Li family?

31:55.830 --> 31:57.440
Have her come out and see me.

31:57.510 --> 31:59.750
I, Shao An, am the steward
of the Li family.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.110
If you have something to say,
say it to me.

32:01.110 --> 32:01.680
Shao An,

32:01.680 --> 32:03.280
y-you should just calm down.

32:04.440 --> 32:05.400
See this?

32:06.840 --> 32:09.100
The order from the Ink Affairs Official.

32:09.310 --> 32:13.160
Our Tian family is a court-designated
Tribute Ink supplier.

32:13.400 --> 32:16.590
We're now requisitioning the Li family's
pine timber for ink production.

32:16.590 --> 32:18.400
Have your manager come out

32:19.200 --> 32:20.480
and name a price.

32:20.720 --> 32:23.270
Tomorrow, our family
will send people and carts

32:23.270 --> 32:25.000
to haul this batch of pine timber away.

32:25.000 --> 32:25.640
Go on.

32:25.880 --> 32:27.590
Is the pine timber you want
the batch our Sixth Master

32:27.590 --> 32:29.400
brought down from Mount Huang?

32:29.720 --> 32:30.720
If not that batch,

32:31.710 --> 32:33.470
which one could it be?

32:35.550 --> 32:38.270
Order of the Huizhou Ink Affairs Official:

32:39.070 --> 32:43.270
Since Tian Ink Workshop is responsible for
producing Tribute Ink,

32:43.350 --> 32:45.750
and pine soot is required as
a raw material,

32:45.830 --> 32:49.510
it is hereby ordered that pine timber
be requisitioned from Li Ink Workshop

32:49.510 --> 32:52.170
to supply Tian Ink Workshop
for production use.

32:52.200 --> 32:52.910
Everyone, out of the way!

32:52.910 --> 32:56.440
This requisition shall amount to
5,000 units of pine timber...

32:59.440 --> 33:01.550
Where did this mad dog come from?

33:01.920 --> 33:02.720
Get lost!

33:02.790 --> 33:04.720
Get lost! Hurry up and get lost!

33:04.750 --> 33:06.480
I've delivered the message.

33:08.110 --> 33:08.960
And now,

33:09.350 --> 33:11.160
I'll give you another 7 days.

33:11.720 --> 33:12.750
Within 7 days,

33:13.030 --> 33:15.920
I want this batch of pine timber
delivered to our Tian family's door.

33:15.920 --> 33:18.960
Otherwise, it'll be treated as
obstruction of imperial duties—

33:18.960 --> 33:22.000
a crime punishable by
sealing the workshop and imprisonment!

33:22.000 --> 33:22.790
Make way!

33:22.790 --> 33:24.480
Get out of here!

33:24.720 --> 33:25.250
Get lost!

33:29.240 --> 33:31.030
Slow down, slow down.

33:31.510 --> 33:32.550
Don't touch me!

33:34.480 --> 33:35.680
The Tian family wants

33:35.880 --> 33:38.200
to requisition our pine timber?

33:39.030 --> 33:41.200
Over my dead body!

33:43.160 --> 33:45.680
Uncle Jingdong, please calm down.

33:45.790 --> 33:47.680
We all feel the same way.

33:48.270 --> 33:50.440
Sixth Grandfather risked his life
for this batch of pine timber.

33:50.440 --> 33:51.750
We won't give it to anyone else

33:51.750 --> 33:53.150
unless we have no choice.

33:54.960 --> 33:56.750
Now the Tian family has used dirty tricks

33:56.750 --> 33:57.830
and got an official document.

33:57.830 --> 33:58.790
They even threatened

33:58.790 --> 34:00.680
that if we don't hand over
this batch of pine timber,

34:00.680 --> 34:02.680
they'll shut down our ink workshop.

34:02.750 --> 34:03.510
This time,

34:03.590 --> 34:05.550
Steward Shao managed to drive them away.

34:05.550 --> 34:06.680
Next time they come,

34:06.790 --> 34:08.510
I'm afraid they'll just take it by force.

34:08.510 --> 34:10.590
We need to think of a good countermeasure.

34:10.590 --> 34:11.850
Zhen, I'm telling you.

34:12.800 --> 34:14.670
You can think of your countermeasures.

34:14.670 --> 34:15.880
If they dare to come,

34:16.150 --> 34:18.360
I'll fight them with these two crutches!

34:18.360 --> 34:19.880
That's my countermeasure!

34:19.880 --> 34:21.150
Don't get so worked up yet.

34:21.150 --> 34:22.960
How come your temper flares up so fast?

34:22.960 --> 34:24.420
Let's think it over first.

34:24.440 --> 34:26.170
There's nothing to think over.

34:26.760 --> 34:27.960
Those filthy scumbags

34:27.960 --> 34:29.230
of the Tian family.

34:29.280 --> 34:30.280
Let them come!

34:31.360 --> 34:33.070
Watch how I deal with them!

34:34.800 --> 34:35.480
You,

34:35.880 --> 34:38.150
go get my bedroll.

34:38.150 --> 34:39.610
I'll just live right here.

34:39.630 --> 34:41.159
Let's see who dares to come.

34:41.280 --> 34:42.030
Go get it.

34:42.670 --> 34:43.760
Hurry up and go!

34:44.150 --> 34:45.400
Go!

34:49.920 --> 34:50.760
Zhen.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.030
Steward Shao, you're here too.

34:54.030 --> 34:54.960
How did it go?

34:57.030 --> 34:58.590
The Tian family has nothing
but bad people,

34:58.590 --> 34:59.550
I'm telling you.

35:00.110 --> 35:01.360
Aside from our Li family,

35:01.360 --> 35:03.510
several other families' pine timber
has also been requisitioned,

35:03.510 --> 35:06.550
and they specifically demanded
only century-old pine.

35:06.550 --> 35:08.400
Right, they didn't force down the price,

35:08.400 --> 35:10.440
but some people were unwilling to sell.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.360
And then, those bastards

35:11.360 --> 35:13.480
just took out the Ink Affairs Official's
official order

35:13.480 --> 35:15.110
and took the pine timber by force.

35:15.110 --> 35:16.110
Ever since Lord Yan

35:16.110 --> 35:17.190
won the Tribute Ink selection

35:17.190 --> 35:18.670
and met that arrogant Taoist priest,

35:18.670 --> 35:20.070
he seems like
a completely different person.

35:20.070 --> 35:22.880
Now he's even helping the wicked
perpetrate wicked deeds.

35:22.880 --> 35:24.110
I asked Xianglan.

35:24.800 --> 35:26.800
Lord Yan was also forced.

35:27.360 --> 35:29.320
Sage Qing He invoked
the royal preceptor's name

35:29.320 --> 35:30.670
to make him give the order.

35:30.670 --> 35:32.110
Lord Yan had no choice.

35:32.630 --> 35:34.440
Now, if we hand over

35:35.110 --> 35:36.280
Li Ink's pine timber,

35:36.280 --> 35:38.340
not only will we fail Uncle Jingdong,

35:38.710 --> 35:40.280
but most of the contracts we signed
with those old ink merchants

35:40.280 --> 35:41.960
are for pine soot ink.

35:42.710 --> 35:44.310
If we disappoint them again,

35:45.320 --> 35:47.320
Li Ink's reputation will be ruined.

35:48.710 --> 35:50.440
But if we refuse to hand it over,

35:51.960 --> 35:53.890
I'm afraid this disaster for Li Ink

35:55.110 --> 35:56.710
won't be avoidable, either.

36:01.230 --> 36:02.400
Don't panic for now.

36:02.550 --> 36:03.550
How about this?

36:03.960 --> 36:06.490
I'll go to the ink merchants
I'm familiar with

36:06.510 --> 36:08.000
and see if they can switch
part of their orders

36:08.000 --> 36:09.200
to lacquer-soot ink.

36:09.710 --> 36:11.150
If that still doesn't work,

36:11.150 --> 36:12.710
I'll try negotiating with them

36:12.710 --> 36:15.240
and ask to delay the delivery
of these orders.

36:15.880 --> 36:17.610
That's the only option for now.

36:19.320 --> 36:20.760
Alright. I'm going.

36:30.550 --> 36:31.810
Seventh Grandmother,

36:32.510 --> 36:34.070
I'm here to see you again.

36:37.480 --> 36:38.740
Seventh Grandmother,

36:40.000 --> 36:42.660
managing this household
is just too difficult.

36:43.480 --> 36:45.510
Just when things started looking up

36:46.400 --> 36:48.530
and I thought I could finally breathe,

36:49.880 --> 36:51.030
trouble

36:52.030 --> 36:53.320
came right after.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.820
There's not a single moment of peace.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.740
Seventh Grandmother,

37:02.800 --> 37:04.460
have you lived your whole life

37:05.110 --> 37:06.920
like this?

37:08.400 --> 37:09.920
You must be exhausted,

37:10.840 --> 37:13.370
which is why
you've been sleeping for so long.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.060
Seventh Grandmother.

37:20.810 --> 37:22.410
Please wake up soon.

37:35.630 --> 37:36.590
Miss Li Zhen.

37:37.150 --> 37:38.480
I warmed up some porridge.

37:38.480 --> 37:40.280
Have a bowl while you're at it.

37:41.360 --> 37:42.420
Thank you, Granny.

37:44.320 --> 37:45.670
I heard from Eldest Aunt

37:45.960 --> 37:47.630
that you are Doggie's grandmother,

37:47.630 --> 37:50.960
and you came specially
to take care of Seventh Grandmother.

37:52.070 --> 37:53.130
-Miss.
-Thanks...

37:53.840 --> 37:56.440
I have an ugly face.
I hope I didn't scare you.

37:59.280 --> 38:00.320
Of course not.

38:00.590 --> 38:01.990
I don't mind such things.

38:02.400 --> 38:04.000
Ever since you came, Granny,

38:04.070 --> 38:06.110
Seventh Grandmother's complexion
has improved a lot.

38:06.110 --> 38:08.320
It shows you've been
taking great care of her.

38:08.320 --> 38:10.580
I should be the one thanking you, Granny.

38:11.280 --> 38:14.540
Seventh Old Madam and I
have been friends since childhood.

38:14.630 --> 38:16.190
We are as close as sisters.

38:16.400 --> 38:18.070
It's what I should do.

38:21.230 --> 38:23.550
This red date porridge
nourishes the blood and qi.

38:23.550 --> 38:26.350
You should eat some
and go back to rest early, Miss.

38:26.710 --> 38:27.840
There's nothing

38:28.280 --> 38:30.550
a good sleep can't solve.

38:32.750 --> 38:33.810
Thank you, Granny.

38:49.800 --> 38:51.590
This pine soot smell is...

38:52.280 --> 38:56.030
The oil lamp on the table
burns rosin oil.

38:57.510 --> 38:58.670
Rosin oil?

39:00.480 --> 39:03.680
I usually serve as a temple keeper
at the Li family temple.

39:04.150 --> 39:07.110
There's a small pine forest
on the hill behind the temple.

39:07.110 --> 39:09.770
I often go collect pine rosin
to light the lamps.

39:10.840 --> 39:13.670
When your Seventh Grandmother
came over, she always said

39:13.670 --> 39:15.330
the smell was soothing to her,

39:15.960 --> 39:17.670
so I brought some here.

39:28.190 --> 39:29.760
Rosin oil...

39:34.190 --> 39:34.990
Eighth Uncle.

39:40.360 --> 39:42.160
Jingdong, Eighth Uncle is here.

39:45.760 --> 39:47.220
Have a seat, Eighth Uncle.

39:58.390 --> 40:00.160
You two can talk, Eighth Uncle.

40:00.190 --> 40:01.320
I'll head out first.

40:18.480 --> 40:19.280
Eighth Uncle.

40:20.230 --> 40:23.630
You're also here to persuade me
to give up

40:25.090 --> 40:26.920
this batch of pine timber, aren't you?

40:26.920 --> 40:27.550
Yes.

40:30.960 --> 40:32.360
This batch of pine timber

40:33.550 --> 40:35.710
cost my father his life.

40:36.320 --> 40:38.840
Even if I die,

40:39.630 --> 40:41.320
I will protect them.

40:44.760 --> 40:45.710
I know.

40:46.030 --> 40:47.590
Since you already know,

40:48.630 --> 40:49.760
please leave.

40:54.110 --> 40:55.000
Jingdong,

40:56.280 --> 40:57.410
I've been thinking,

40:58.880 --> 41:00.540
what your father truly wanted

41:01.320 --> 41:02.840
was not this pine timber,

41:04.440 --> 41:06.000
but your clarity of mind

41:07.110 --> 41:09.320
and the century-old legacy of Li Ink.

41:15.960 --> 41:16.840
Eighth Uncle.

41:17.850 --> 41:19.520
My father was not like you,

41:20.030 --> 41:23.110
one of the Five Ink-making Grandmasters
of Ming.

41:23.110 --> 41:25.150
Your life has had its ups and downs,

41:25.150 --> 41:27.350
worthy of praise by later generations.

41:28.510 --> 41:29.360
But him?

41:30.000 --> 41:32.280
He lost in ink making his whole life.

41:32.800 --> 41:34.630
But he worked diligently

41:34.630 --> 41:37.070
and toiled for Li Ink his whole life.

41:39.960 --> 41:41.280
This pine timber

41:43.440 --> 41:44.840
is proof that he lived,

41:46.280 --> 41:49.030
that he risked his life for Li Ink.

41:51.000 --> 41:53.230
This is the memento he left for me.

41:54.150 --> 41:57.510
How could you bear to
let those filthy things

41:57.710 --> 41:58.880
ruin it?

42:04.920 --> 42:05.840
Jingdong.

42:10.320 --> 42:12.120
Are you going to die for the pine,

42:12.630 --> 42:15.360
or live for your father's dying wish?

42:15.880 --> 42:17.280
Which is more important?

42:34.110 --> 42:35.510
What Sixth Grandfather left behind

42:35.510 --> 42:38.240
is definitely not just
this batch of pine timber.

42:38.320 --> 42:39.250
Uncle Jingdong.

42:39.800 --> 42:42.510
Sixth Grandfather was a prominent figure
in the Li family.

42:42.510 --> 42:44.510
He took over Li Ink in times of crisis

42:44.590 --> 42:46.850
and served as a role model
for the Li clan.

42:47.920 --> 42:50.360
I've already discussed this
with Eldest Aunt,

42:50.360 --> 42:51.110
and now,

42:51.670 --> 42:54.200
I want to let you know as well,
Uncle Jingdong.

42:55.320 --> 42:57.780
As head of the household,
I, Li Zhen, propose

42:57.840 --> 43:00.240
to hang his portrait
in the ancestral hall,

43:00.400 --> 43:02.150
sharing the Li family's incense offerings

43:02.150 --> 43:03.670
along with our ancestor Li Tinggui.
